WEBVTT

00:19.720 --> 00:25.040
dare mo shiranai basho de

00:19.720 --> 00:25.040
In a place nobody knows

00:25.860 --> 00:30.720
asa ga umare hajimeru

00:25.860 --> 00:30.720
The dawn is being born

00:31.270 --> 00:37.160
hoshi notta negai wo ima wa

00:31.270 --> 00:37.160
The dreams riding on the backs of stars

00:37.160 --> 00:43.060
hikari wo naku shi yuka no ue koborete iru

00:37.160 --> 00:43.060
Are burning out and falling broken to the ground

00:43.360 --> 00:51.970
sotto sugu dare ni te wo nobasu

00:43.360 --> 00:51.970
But suddenly someone reaches out their hand

00:55.380 --> 00:58.290
boku no koe wa sekai wo komete

00:55.380 --> 00:58.290
And my voice envelops the entire world

00:58.290 --> 01:01.430
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

00:58.290 --> 01:01.430
How long will I struggle on for you?

01:01.550 --> 01:04.310
hitori kiri mo nashi yume gao ite mo

01:01.550 --> 01:04.310
Until nothing remains but your dreaming face!

01:04.560 --> 01:07.450
douka kashi de wasureyou ni

01:04.560 --> 01:07.450
How can I forget the words to this song when

01:07.450 --> 01:10.530
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

01:07.450 --> 01:10.530
My fingers can touch all of creation?

01:10.530 --> 01:15.920
tobira akete haru ga kanata e

01:10.530 --> 01:15.920
Open the door, and Spring will be waiting for you there.

01:31.800 --> 01:37.450
If God really existed, and was able to grant any wish...

01:38.830 --> 01:41.590
I wonder what people would wish for?

01:57.840 --> 02:00.790
I wonder what Samatarou is...

02:05.680 --> 02:07.380
wishing for right now?

02:11.460 --> 02:15.220
Do you believe in God?

02:11.460 --> 02:15.220
Timing, editing, encoding, "translation": Chikushou
Please destroy this funsub upon a real group subbing it!

02:20.810 --> 02:23.070
Okay everyone, stay focused.

02:23.070 --> 02:25.950
The next topic of discussion is as follows:

02:27.770 --> 02:30.530
Shall we abolish the wearing of bloomers or not?

02:34.800 --> 02:40.570
I have been instructed by the principal to discuss with you whether we should abolish bloomers to prevent distractions.

02:40.570 --> 02:41.390
Huh?

02:41.390 --> 02:43.390
What?

02:49.980 --> 02:50.740
Samatarou...

02:50.740 --> 02:51.740
Huh?

02:51.740 --> 02:55.070
You're not thinking about anything perverted, are you?

02:55.570 --> 02:58.880
I'm not really thinking about anything in particular.

02:58.900 --> 03:00.460
Tenko, quit overanalzying things.

03:01.470 --> 03:02.970
I guess it's okay then.

03:02.970 --> 03:05.170
But! However!

03:05.420 --> 03:06.050
Eh?

03:06.050 --> 03:11.630
I like bloomers! I really like 'em! Actually, I love 'em!

03:11.630 --> 03:12.890
What the?

03:14.330 --> 03:17.410
That's why I sure as hell won't let them be abolished!

03:17.620 --> 03:22.590
If someone thinks they can take away my precious bloomers, there's NO WAY IN HELL I'LL LET THEM!

03:25.050 --> 03:26.410
Bl-bloomers?!

03:26.410 --> 03:27.570
He's wearing bloomers!

03:27.570 --> 03:28.790
Yup, yup!

03:29.270 --> 03:32.470
If you've got a problem with it, bring it on!

03:36.490 --> 03:38.950
Woah, the teacher's a crossdresser!

03:44.540 --> 03:47.600
Oh moon, shine your light upon my trembling hands.

03:48.490 --> 03:49.850
What the heck was that?

03:49.850 --> 03:51.900
Who knows, maybe it's 'cause of this heat...

03:51.900 --> 03:53.330
You did this, huh?

03:53.330 --> 03:55.230
It wasn't me.

03:55.230 --> 03:57.960
Then who else could it've been?

04:00.550 --> 04:05.390
You were thinking "getting rid of bloomers would suck," weren't you?

04:06.140 --> 04:07.770
K...kinda.

04:07.770 --> 04:09.000
I knew it!

04:09.000 --> 04:13.020
Quit letting dad spoil you every time you want something!

04:14.180 --> 04:16.020
Dad has nothing to do with this!

04:17.180 --> 04:19.490
You called for me?

04:21.880 --> 04:23.510
Daddy's here!

04:26.650 --> 04:27.670
Pops...

04:27.670 --> 04:28.830
Samatarou...

04:33.800 --> 04:35.990
It really was you who did this, huh?

04:36.330 --> 04:40.620
Well, ya know... I can always hear what's going on in the afternoons.

04:40.620 --> 04:43.070
"It'd be better to keep bloomers around"

04:40.620 --> 04:43.070
It'd be better to keep bloomers around

04:44.440 --> 04:47.500
That's why I spontaneously decided to do that.

04:47.500 --> 04:48.930
A miracle!

04:56.090 --> 05:00.590
You can't keep doing stuff like this. Act more like a God for once!

05:01.000 --> 05:04.680
Well, even gods like to be doting parents every now and then...

05:05.020 --> 05:08.760
"Every now and then"?! You're always doing crap like this!

05:09.380 --> 05:13.530
Why do you think Samatarou is living in this world in the first place?

05:14.760 --> 05:17.550
In order to succeed me, he needs to experience the human way of life for himself.

05:17.620 --> 05:20.420
Only then can he become a proper god.

05:20.420 --> 05:23.620
That's why making miracles for him is a bad idea, isn't it?!

05:25.390 --> 05:28.190
What's up with them? Having another argument?

05:28.660 --> 05:30.980
They're only fighting 'cause they're so close.

05:30.980 --> 05:32.270
Sorry.

05:32.270 --> 05:33.980
"Sorry" isn't good enough.

05:33.980 --> 05:36.840
Jeez, going overboard again...

05:36.840 --> 05:39.020
It's your fault for thinking about stuff like that.

05:39.020 --> 05:42.020
Well sooorry for thinking!

05:42.020 --> 05:45.490
You're supposed to be an angel, but you're acting like a bitch.

05:46.950 --> 05:49.920
I'm a guardian angel sent by God!

05:49.920 --> 05:52.170
I'm expected to speak up at times like this.

05:52.170 --> 05:54.290
Now, now, you two.

05:54.290 --> 05:55.650
Get outta here, Pops.

05:55.650 --> 05:56.940
Papa, you're getting in the way.

05:57.970 --> 05:59.940
Fine. I'll leave.

06:06.010 --> 06:08.730
In the end they didn't get rid of bloomers.

06:08.730 --> 06:11.530
That's great, isn't it, Samatarou? Turned out just how you thought it would.

06:11.530 --> 06:12.480
Shut it.

06:12.480 --> 06:16.980
I feel sorry that the teacher had to go home early because of all that stress.

06:17.660 --> 06:21.540
It's not like I asked him to do that. It just kinda happened.

06:21.880 --> 06:23.930
"Asked him," huh?

06:24.610 --> 06:28.770
When Samatarou wants anything, it'll always fall right into his hands...

06:30.200 --> 06:32.990
If he thinks "that'd be nice," it always turns out just as he wants.

06:36.470 --> 06:39.330
Samatarou doesn't have any particular powers himself, but...

06:40.220 --> 06:44.850
And even though he's trying to figure out humanity's reason for living on his own,

06:48.390 --> 06:50.850
Papa's really spoiling him too much.

06:52.480 --> 06:54.590
H-hey! Wait up!

06:54.590 --> 06:57.120
You're a guy and I'm a girl!

06:57.120 --> 07:00.050
Think about how fast you're walking!

07:03.930 --> 07:05.290
Go home by yourself.

07:05.290 --> 07:06.320
Huh?

07:06.320 --> 07:08.630
What? Why?

07:08.630 --> 07:11.560
I'm your guardian, so I'm going home with you!

07:12.450 --> 07:14.560
We don't know if anything else might happen.

07:15.170 --> 07:19.060
Don't you know what everyone in class is saying about us?

07:19.810 --> 07:21.170
Dunno.

07:21.650 --> 07:22.670
That we're...

07:22.670 --> 07:24.670
Going out...

07:24.710 --> 07:25.870
Yeah, yeah.

07:25.870 --> 07:27.100
Really?!

07:27.580 --> 07:28.530
What?

07:28.530 --> 07:30.440
Hey you two!

07:30.850 --> 07:31.870
Shinichi?

07:31.870 --> 07:33.160
Shinichi...

07:33.160 --> 07:35.070
Am I getting in the way?

07:35.070 --> 07:36.500
Sure are.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.280
Wanna go to the arcade?

07:38.280 --> 07:40.280
They changed the prices.

07:40.460 --> 07:42.090
Seriously? I'll go!

07:42.090 --> 07:43.390
No way.

07:44.480 --> 07:46.520
I won't allow you to barge in on us.

07:46.520 --> 07:49.320
Samatarou is going straight home.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.900
Why? I'm going!

07:51.900 --> 07:53.130
No you aren't.

07:53.130 --> 07:55.860
Places like the arcade are devils' hangouts!

07:55.860 --> 07:58.860
What's with that? Don't decide for me.

07:58.860 --> 08:05.530
Tenko, I know you don't wanna separate from him, but it'd be an educational experience.

08:06.010 --> 08:09.080
That's right. That'd be studying, too!

08:09.280 --> 08:11.800
You don't have to study crap like that.

08:12.480 --> 08:16.980
Jeez. You yap at me all day. How about letting me do what I want for once?

08:21.410 --> 08:24.340
Te-Tenko, did I just see steam come out of your head?

08:24.340 --> 08:25.430
No, you didn't!

08:26.200 --> 08:27.040
But...

08:27.040 --> 08:28.210
You didn't see jack!

08:28.980 --> 08:30.950
Oh my, how lively you guys are!

08:38.650 --> 08:40.020
Sis?

08:41.450 --> 08:43.080
Shinichi, was it?

08:43.080 --> 08:44.510
Ah, yes!

08:44.510 --> 08:47.780
Thank you for always having fun with Samatarou.

08:47.780 --> 08:53.920
You're welcome. I'm grateful just to have been able to hear your voice!

08:53.920 --> 08:55.760
Ha, she's acting all nice to him.

08:58.350 --> 09:00.530
Well, I'm in a hurry so...

09:01.750 --> 09:05.030
Misa sure is nice...

09:05.300 --> 09:07.680
I'm envious of you, Samatarou!

09:07.680 --> 09:08.640
Huh?

09:10.270 --> 09:11.840
What the...

09:12.390 --> 09:16.270
Jeez. What the hell? Let go of me!

09:18.790 --> 09:20.840
What's wrong with the arcade?

09:20.840 --> 09:22.950
One more word outta you and I'll kick your ass.

09:24.110 --> 09:26.420
You wanna go? Bring it--

09:29.630 --> 09:31.330
Sonofa...

09:33.650 --> 09:36.370
Sheesh, you're always disobeying me.

09:36.850 --> 09:40.940
You're the son of God, so that shouldn't have hurt much, right?

09:41.420 --> 09:45.840
It's my heart that hurts. Having a guardian angel is depressing sometimes.

09:46.460 --> 09:49.120
Well, it's not that I like doing this...

09:53.270 --> 09:58.930
The two of us were born in the same hospital on the same day at the same time, right?

09:59.810 --> 10:01.450
Coochy coochy coo!

10:02.270 --> 10:06.770
More like you appeared in front of the hospital.

10:06.770 --> 10:08.130
Yeah...

10:09.010 --> 10:12.970
In order to have a guardian angel...

10:13.440 --> 10:15.080
Papa brought me.

10:15.080 --> 10:18.080
She's an angel, so her name will be Tenko (Heaven's Child).

10:21.550 --> 10:23.190
Wait up!

10:24.550 --> 10:25.510
Samatarou...

10:26.120 --> 10:28.230
You were so nice to me back in kindergarten.

10:31.430 --> 10:33.000
Really?

10:33.820 --> 10:35.050
But you...

10:35.050 --> 10:37.430
Kept getting meaner and meaner.

10:38.590 --> 10:41.720
It's 'cause you kept getting more annoying.

10:44.040 --> 10:45.200
But that's...

10:47.450 --> 10:50.920
That's part of my duty as an angel!

11:01.830 --> 11:06.870
But Pops sure is cheesy. Naming you Tenko 'cause you're an angel...

11:06.870 --> 11:08.030
Really?

11:08.030 --> 11:09.870
I think it fits me.

11:14.910 --> 11:15.930
Tenko...

11:15.930 --> 11:16.820
What?

11:18.050 --> 11:19.270
Sorry.

11:21.660 --> 11:23.360
We always make up.

11:28.610 --> 11:30.650
It looks totally normal but,

11:30.650 --> 11:36.650
This is where the son of God pursues knowledge of the human world under the guidance of sacred scriptures.

11:42.990 --> 11:46.410
Congratulations about the bloomers!

11:53.250 --> 11:54.110
What's wrong?

12:11.140 --> 12:14.040
Pops put you guys up to this, didn't he?

12:14.280 --> 12:15.320
Come on now...

12:15.490 --> 12:19.670
Mama's just doing her best for her cute son!

12:19.670 --> 12:20.190
How's that?

12:20.640 --> 12:23.120
Mom, you're supposed to be a goddess.

12:23.160 --> 12:25.750
Isn't a getup like that embarrassing?

12:26.060 --> 12:28.340
I guess, maybe I should take more off.

12:28.750 --> 12:31.550
Putting on clothes halves my beauty.

12:33.940 --> 12:35.210
I guess I'll get naked.

12:35.210 --> 12:36.390
You don't have to do that!

12:37.220 --> 12:41.260
Misa, Meme! You're candidates for goddess...

12:41.570 --> 12:43.050
You can't do stuff like this!

12:43.300 --> 12:47.030
Don't be so selfish. We're not forbidden from wearing bloomers.

12:47.370 --> 12:49.240
Really, we're just celebrating.

12:51.170 --> 12:56.280
Meme, I told you not to listen to what your mom and sister tell you.

12:56.530 --> 12:58.320
Papa was the one who told me to do it.

12:59.460 --> 13:02.190
Papa's the last person you should be listening to!

13:02.430 --> 13:04.640
Coldhearted, aren't you, Tenko.

13:05.060 --> 13:08.720
Bloomers!

13:08.720 --> 13:09.510
Papa!

13:09.510 --> 13:10.550
Pops!

13:10.830 --> 13:12.730
Everybody, let's go!

13:28.720 --> 13:30.480
When you say "bloomers..."

13:30.790 --> 13:33.280
You think "athletic festival!"

13:39.600 --> 13:40.360
Take that!

13:42.850 --> 13:45.230
Scavenger hunt!

13:44.260 --> 13:45.960
Yay!

13:45.230 --> 13:46.230
<i>Samatarou Kamiyama</i>

13:51.030 --> 13:52.550
Samatarou!

13:55.420 --> 13:57.600
Be careful not to get crushed!

14:05.160 --> 14:06.370
Samatarou!

14:06.370 --> 14:08.370
Hang in there, Samatarou!

14:11.000 --> 14:13.690
Even if you're gods, how many times are you going to go overboard like this?

14:13.930 --> 14:16.320
Sorry~!

14:23.230 --> 14:25.020
Oh, Papa.

14:25.610 --> 14:26.650
Hey, Mama...

14:27.270 --> 14:29.960
Why did you marry Papa?

14:30.380 --> 14:33.170
That's because I love him, of course!

14:39.010 --> 14:40.320
I knew it.

14:42.430 --> 14:44.850
Baths sure are a pain in the ass.

14:45.020 --> 14:47.720
But you hadn't taken one in three days...

14:48.440 --> 14:52.930
We don't even have to take baths in the first place, you know.

14:52.930 --> 14:54.830
It's a waste of time.

14:55.040 --> 14:55.800
I guess.

14:56.250 --> 14:57.490
Yummy!

14:57.490 --> 14:59.700
Oh, it's already this late?

14:59.700 --> 15:01.010
Tenko!

15:01.010 --> 15:02.020
Yes?!

15:02.020 --> 15:03.330
Just a little while longer...

15:03.880 --> 15:06.540
Tofu, mushrooms, meat...

15:06.680 --> 15:07.610
Alright!

15:09.480 --> 15:11.650
I wonder if Samatarou's okay...

15:12.720 --> 15:15.180
What the hell is a "bloomers celebration?!"

15:15.180 --> 15:18.600
Treating me like I'm some kinda toy...

15:19.320 --> 15:21.570
Samatarou, dinner!

15:22.260 --> 15:24.570
You didn't even make it.

15:26.960 --> 15:29.510
My, my. Looks like he's pouting.

15:29.960 --> 15:32.410
Today we're having your favorite, sukiyaki!

15:32.410 --> 15:34.830
If you don't come, we're gonna eat it all!

15:35.210 --> 15:36.320
Meme...

15:40.560 --> 15:44.120
Tenko told me to tell you to hurry up and come down.

15:45.920 --> 15:49.130
But I'd want you to come down even if she didn't ask.

15:50.790 --> 15:54.240
Samatarou, come eat with your family.

16:04.190 --> 16:07.470
As usual, Tenko's cooking is awesome!

16:07.610 --> 16:08.510
Sure is!

16:09.270 --> 16:10.340
Here ya go, Meme.

16:10.510 --> 16:11.410
Thanks.

16:11.860 --> 16:16.040
Come on... Why's nobody else calling for me?!

16:17.870 --> 16:19.630
Is it good? Try some of this.

16:19.040 --> 16:19.770
Yeah, it's good.

16:20.080 --> 16:21.220
Let me have a sip of your beer.

16:21.320 --> 16:22.810
Hey, what're you doing?

16:22.810 --> 16:24.330
Sorry, couldn't help myself.

16:23.740 --> 16:24.990
Samatarou...

16:31.000 --> 16:31.790
Samatarou!

16:33.720 --> 16:36.900
There's some chopped veggies left, so you can eat some later.

16:37.320 --> 16:40.150
Chopped veggies? That's not sukiyaki.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.630
The sukiyaki...

16:41.630 --> 16:45.710
I left a little bit of mine for you.

16:46.440 --> 16:48.130
Oh, but there's no meat.

16:49.610 --> 16:50.370
Well, later.

16:50.510 --> 16:51.440
Later.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.420
Sukiyaki without meat?

17:01.500 --> 17:02.260
Guess I'll sleep.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.650
W-w-w-what the?

17:14.930 --> 17:16.380
Pops? Ma?

17:17.070 --> 17:20.800
Huh? How come we're in Samatarou's bed?

17:20.800 --> 17:23.840
Aww, the kid was already half asleep!

17:23.840 --> 17:25.290
Half asleep?

17:25.920 --> 17:28.330
Your room is on the first floor!

17:28.330 --> 17:30.030
Don't worry about that.

17:30.030 --> 17:32.000
Sometimes the three of us should...

17:32.100 --> 17:33.790
Sleep together!

17:34.210 --> 17:35.350
No way!

17:35.550 --> 17:37.110
Aw, come on.

17:42.670 --> 17:44.850
Man, I guess he's not feeling well.

17:44.850 --> 17:46.920
I only did that 'cause I was worried.

17:48.400 --> 17:49.920
What were they thinking?

17:49.920 --> 17:52.310
I guess everyone was worried about me.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.760
H-huh?

17:55.860 --> 17:57.520
Where's my blanket?

17:57.900 --> 17:59.320
What's this?

18:08.300 --> 18:12.480
I can already smell your cooking before I can even see it, Tenko.

18:14.650 --> 18:16.870
She wasn't joking. There's no meat.

18:21.110 --> 18:22.500
Well then...

18:26.680 --> 18:27.370
Tomorrow...

18:27.540 --> 18:29.920
Guess Tenko's gonna complain again.

18:30.480 --> 18:33.890
Something like, "can't you at least wash the dishes after eating?"

18:39.770 --> 18:42.050
Are you full, Samatarou?

18:51.230 --> 18:52.410
Tenko?!

18:53.450 --> 18:55.830
Why are you sleeping in a place like this?

18:56.170 --> 18:58.000
She's even using my blanket...

18:59.010 --> 19:00.420
I'm so glad...

19:04.390 --> 19:07.750
Could it be she was worried about me and waited here?

19:08.510 --> 19:10.130
Prepared this for me...

19:10.610 --> 19:13.200
And decided to clean up after me when I finished?

19:26.810 --> 19:30.020
But she fell asleep... She's useless.

19:30.160 --> 19:32.480
What the heck do you mean by "useless?!"

19:42.460 --> 19:43.740
Night, Tenko.

19:52.300 --> 19:53.200
Samatarou!

19:58.180 --> 19:59.800
Did Samatarou just...

20:02.250 --> 20:03.250
Huh, why is this...

20:10.610 --> 20:13.240
Maybe Samatarou still has a kind side.

20:13.750 --> 20:14.380
Right?

20:16.380 --> 20:17.900
Thanks, Samatarou.

20:20.180 --> 20:21.320
I'm leaving now!

20:21.320 --> 20:23.460
Hey, wait up, Tenko!

20:23.460 --> 20:24.190
Morning!

20:26.090 --> 20:27.360
Good mooooorning!

20:29.020 --> 20:31.890
What the heck are you doing this early in the morning. You're gonna fall.

20:31.890 --> 20:33.240
I'm fine!

20:40.280 --> 20:41.460
See?

20:46.120 --> 20:47.740
What's going on?!

20:48.680 --> 20:50.650
Why isn't the damn light changing?

20:51.820 --> 20:53.030
Pops, you bastard...

20:53.410 --> 20:54.440
Let's go, Tenko!

20:54.440 --> 20:55.240
O-okay!

21:03.940 --> 21:05.910
Scoop! Scoop!

21:08.470 --> 21:10.090
A transfer student is coming!

21:10.090 --> 21:12.200
I bet she's some hot girl!

21:12.370 --> 21:15.760
There's a bunch of people crowded around the teachers' room, so there's no mistaking it.

21:16.380 --> 21:17.280
Oh?

21:17.520 --> 21:19.040
Ah, I get it.

21:19.490 --> 21:21.870
You're not interested in anyone but Tenko, huh?

21:22.250 --> 21:23.050
Hey now...

21:23.940 --> 21:25.290
A transfer student?

21:26.500 --> 21:29.470
Samatarou, you're living with goddesses.

21:29.920 --> 21:32.540
So I'm sure you wouldn't have interest in normal girls.

21:33.410 --> 21:36.380
Or even an angel like me.

21:37.480 --> 21:39.630
Maybe she'll have a rival now.

21:39.630 --> 21:40.070
Really?

21:40.280 --> 21:42.980
Well uh... Sorry about yesterday.

21:42.980 --> 21:44.460
Looks like I was just worn out.

21:44.460 --> 21:45.190
Oh yeah.

21:45.190 --> 21:47.190
Come on in.

21:47.190 --> 21:47.640
Yes.

22:02.870 --> 22:04.250
I'm Kumiko Komori.

22:04.560 --> 22:05.980
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

22:12.470 --> 22:14.930
That girl's... beautiful.

22:15.410 --> 22:16.030
Huh?

22:16.830 --> 22:17.790
That girl's...

22:18.970 --> 22:19.940
beautiful!

22:26.430 --> 22:27.810
Sama...tarou?

22:40.420 --> 22:42.490
aru ase totsuzen

22:42.490 --> 22:43.350
UH HUH!

22:43.110 --> 22:45.910
sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:46.780 --> 22:49.540
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh)

22:49.710 --> 22:52.370
kimi ni kissu sareru no

22:52.780 --> 22:56.760
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:59.620 --> 23:01.800
dakara atashi kara

23:02.180 --> 23:04.360
ippo fumidasu kedo

23:05.870 --> 23:11.060
suki na daifu kite katta wo doushita

23:11.300 --> 23:17.650
aka mari donna su wo nosete mite mo

23:18.530 --> 23:24.770
kone dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nai nai ka na)

23:26.040 --> 23:31.990
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) ki ni suri tama ei ga mi

23:31.990 --> 23:37.720
sugu modoshitai nando kashiteyo

23:38.010 --> 23:45.480
kotaenasaii sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga

23:46.020 --> 23:52.580
miaeba subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

24:03.910 --> 24:04.600
Tenko!

24:04.740 --> 24:07.560
I'm gonna make her my girlfriend with my own power!

24:07.820 --> 24:08.880
