24:09.250 --> 24:11.640
Okay, I got it. I'll support you!

24:11.640 --> 24:13.140
But what should I do?

24:13.140 --> 24:15.580
Tada! A present from your sister!

24:15.870 --> 24:17.450
An invitation to the pool?

24:17.450 --> 24:18.370
Why that reaction?

24:18.370 --> 24:20.470
It's a group date, you know.

24:20.470 --> 24:21.960
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku:

24:22.110 --> 24:24.660
Operation: Samatarou's Extrme First Love

24:24.660 --> 24:27.660
Don't do anything appropriate with her, okay!
